    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/25635a894c8b523faabb0a9749134378.avif?t=1745203924\" data-has-big width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her friend crashes during a routine mission on a distant planet, a lone android uncovers a conspiracy that threatens not just the planet but the entire universe's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Uncover areas, talk to locals, and destroy enemies in an adventure across an open world.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Combine weapons and abilities like missiles, freeze blasts, and clawshots to overcome all enemies and obstacles in your path.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Collect items scattered throughout the world to unlock the mystery of the planet Cyros.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Unlock different modes that will keep you coming back for more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/82e977c2463a4a28c0bd4dac3e2c98c7.poster.avif?t=1745203924\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/82e977c2463a4a28c0bd4dac3e2c98c7.webm?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/82e977c2463a4a28c0bd4dac3e2c98c7.mp4?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her closest friend disappears during a mission on a distant planet, Esquire Robo, a determined android sets out to uncover the truth. What begins as a simple search quickly spirals into something far more dangerous, revealing a vast conspiracy that extends beyond corporate corruption\u2014one that threatens the very fabric of the planet and possibly the universe itself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/06ce25025a4c2f752f15a97566e1632f.poster.avif?t=1745203924\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/06ce25025a4c2f752f15a97566e1632f.webm?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/06ce25025a4c2f752f15a97566e1632f.mp4?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she pieces together the mystery, she\u2019ll be forced to question everything she knows about her creators, her purpose, and the true nature of the forces at play. With danger closing in and impossible choices ahead, she must decide whether to follow her programming or forge her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/25635a894c8b523faabb0a9749134378.avif?t=1745203924\" data-has-big width=800 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her friend crashes during a routine mission on a distant planet, a lone android uncovers a conspiracy that threatens not just the planet but the entire universe's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Uncover areas, talk to locals, and destroy enemies in an adventure across an open world.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Combine weapons and abilities like missiles, freeze blasts, and clawshots to overcome all enemies and obstacles in your path.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Collect items scattered throughout the world to unlock the mystery of the planet Cyros.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Unlock different modes that will keep you coming back for more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/82e977c2463a4a28c0bd4dac3e2c98c7.poster.avif?t=1745203924\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/82e977c2463a4a28c0bd4dac3e2c98c7.webm?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/82e977c2463a4a28c0bd4dac3e2c98c7.mp4?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her closest friend disappears during a mission on a distant planet, Esquire Robo, a determined android sets out to uncover the truth. What begins as a simple search quickly spirals into something far more dangerous, revealing a vast conspiracy that extends beyond corporate corruption\u2014one that threatens the very fabric of the planet and possibly the universe itself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/06ce25025a4c2f752f15a97566e1632f.poster.avif?t=1745203924\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/06ce25025a4c2f752f15a97566e1632f.webm?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518400/extras/06ce25025a4c2f752f15a97566e1632f.mp4?t=1745203924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she pieces together the mystery, she\u2019ll be forced to question everything she knows about her creators, her purpose, and the true nature of the forces at play. With danger closing in and impossible choices ahead, she must decide whether to follow her programming or forge her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
